Subject: [PATCH] Add video quality and weak-network tuning settings

Video quality: auto/1080p/720p/480p/360p/240p, applied live (default 240p, as before).
Weak network tuning, each tap-to-cycle: buffer size, network timeout, retry attempts,
live delay, smooth quality switching. Defaults match the previous behaviour.
